{"id":"91dfddd12189e300","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Top Convergence Sequence","display":"df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence — ZFC Top Convergence Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence — ZFC Top Convergence Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence — ZFC Top Convergence Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d490b03448142d4c\" href=\"?note=d490b03448142d4c\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,x,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(s,x,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to s(m)\\in U)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to s(m)\\in U)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence is now required to take values in the declared topological\ncarrier, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is required to be a topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"d490b03448142d4c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-seq-omega-sequence.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,x,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top},\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S(s,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSeqOmegaSequence}_S(s,X)\n\\land x\\in X\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\left(\nx\\in U\\to\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\n(n\\leq m\\to s(m)\\in U)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":1167,"backlinks":[{"id":"ceb42112e28c7ff5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S$ (sequence-convergence predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"c46a4f13f0281f9b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e5734c9b50963c3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopConvergenceSequence}_S$（序列收敛谓词，见 [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3517","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-top-convergence-sequence]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e7514bc4cefba4f2","d490b03448142d4c"]}